WEBVTT

1
00:00:20.623 --> 00:00:23.790
<v><b>A:</b></v> Wow! You look great.

2
00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:26.730
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thanks. You too.

3
00:00:36.379 --> 00:00:42.259
<v><b>A:</b></v> So, where do you want to go?

4
00:00:42.711 --> 00:00:46.632
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s your city. I’m a tourist.

5
00:00:49.259 --> 00:00:51.004
I’m in your hands.

6
00:01:00.373 --> 00:01:01.569
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where are we going?

7
00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:02.269
<v><b>B:</b></v> Follow me.

8
00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.404
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you want to go in?

9
00:01:16.947 --> 00:01:17.497
<v><b>B:</b></v> Sure.

10
00:01:26.974 --> 00:01:28.438
<v><b>A:</b></v> Have a great time, Ben.

11
00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:32.057
<v><b>B:</b></v> OK, thanks. Say ‘hi’ to Rob and the kids.